Package: lookout-deepstream-yolo-assets
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, curl, ca-certificates
Description: LOOKOUT DeepStream YOLO model bundle and parser assets
 Installs the JP6/DS7-ready LOOKOUT parser shared library, labels, configs,
 and supporting DeepStream asset files under /opt/lookout/deepstream/assets/.
 Large model artifacts are fetched at install time and verified against the
 packaged checksum manifest.
